the game gives","body":"A course is set: she was bound somewhere when your hand took the helm (the course waited). The air is thick: the steersman makes out a landfall at under a kilometre (fog, heavy rain).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"1747a05e-d3ac-4f69-a7db-59fdf18113ed","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
